WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:03.027
I suspect this is Prince Ning's trap.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.067
This is a forged edict Your Highness need not obey.

00:07.880 --> 00:12.000
First report illness to the court say after I recover.

00:12.480 --> 00:15.813
I will return to the capital to ask for punishment.

00:25.400 --> 00:29.600
He didn't get sick earlier or later but.

00:30.080 --> 00:31.480
At this time.

00:40.760 --> 00:45.600
Have the Ministry of War issue another edict using Prince of Jin's illness as reason have Chen Ying.

00:45.720 --> 00:48.800
Take over his military command test his limits.

00:49.000 --> 00:49.680
Yes.

00:49.760 --> 00:51.427
I'll do it right away.

01:05.240 --> 01:10.240
Prince of Jin I come by court order to take over Yiyang military affairs.

01:14.960 --> 01:20.880
I heard Your Highness is unwell I specially brought from the army the best physician how about.

01:21.000 --> 01:25.880
Let him examine Your Highness no need no need.

01:26.400 --> 01:31.040
My body has already improved soon.

01:31.120 --> 01:36.520
I can return to court that's great as long as it doesn't affect the military handover.

01:36.600 --> 01:39.280
Chen Ying what do you mean?

01:39.480 --> 01:41.000
Trying to burn bridges?

01:41.120 --> 01:45.093
Xie Xuan is it your place to speak here?

01:49.200 --> 01:55.160
If Your Highness has concerns then write a letter to the court then whatever the court says.

01:55.240 --> 01:59.800
I will do accordingly Your Highness not difficult, right?

